  "body": "I'm using this module through React-Native-Url-Preview / link-preview-js / cross-fetch so it's hard to follow but ultimately when I pass a URL with a redirect (e.g. \"news.bbc.co.uk\") I get an error event response through EventTarget.xhr.onerror(fetch.umd.js:474)\r\nI can see in flipper that a 301 has been returned by the site so I'm surprised that that becomes an error event.\r\nThis seems to happen to many sites with a 301, though not all. I think the response headers are different though I don't see why any 301 is an error",
